	(text "TWO CHANGES BASED ON THE OFFICIAL CIRCUIT FROM THE BLUE ROBOTICS WEBSITE:\n1. Probe-break detection: I tried to replace the MOSFET with the ADC, GPIO of the MCU and add 5 End-Of-Line resistor to deal with probe-break situation\n2. I added a capacitor to smooth the voltage against background noise\n"
